@@R2@@
===
length by drawing the string through the slit. Make this length 9⅞ inches. The pendulum swings backwards and forwards 120 times in 60 seconds, and hence 20 times in 10 seconds. Adjust it more accurately by a seconds watch. Counting the swings one way only there are 10 @@R2@@
